QuickConvertTest
└── quickConvert
    ├── given fiat text
    │   ├── it handles a plain selection
    │   ├── it understands every format the page parser does
    │   └── given the currency has no rate
    │       └── it returns nothing
    ├── given a ZEC amount
    │   ├── it converts back the other way
    │   ├── it accepts zats on the way back
    │   ├── it always uses spot, never the held rate
    │   ├── given the amount is negative
    │   │   └── it returns nothing
    │   ├── given the amount does not parse
    │   │   └── it returns nothing
    │   └── given the display currency has no rate
    │       └── it returns nothing
    └── given text with no price in it
        ├── it returns nothing
        └── given the text is empty
            └── it returns nothing
